      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e try/finally here will silence situation where there is regression\n\nThe exception isn\u0027t handled, so it [should be raised once `finally` has executed](https://docs.python.org/3/reference/compound_stmts.html#finally):\n\n\u003e If an exception occurs in any of the clauses and is not handled, the exception is temporarily saved. The finally clause is executed. If there is a saved exception it is re-raised at the end of the finally clause.",
